WEBVTT

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:28.590
999 B.C.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:47.310
<i>That man was born a king.</i>

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:49.440
<i>However, he...</i>

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.940
THE TIME OF BIRTH HATH COME,
I AM THE REMEDY OF ETERNITY.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:56.240
<i>did not seek omnipotence
and sought only knowledge.</i>

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.740
THE TIME OF CORONATION HATH COME,
I AM THE BEGINNING OF ETERNITY.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>Being given miracles of God,</i>

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:06.630
<i>he only used it once.</i>

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.850
<i>His ten rings hold dominion
over all of Magecraft.</i>

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:26.020
<i>His eyes can see the past and future.</i>

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:30.690
<i>His summoning spell
has 72 Demon Gods at his service.</i>

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:41.830
<i>The name of the summoning spell is "Goetia."</i>

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:50.040
<i>The King of Mages, lauded as having
nothing impossible for him...</i>

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.300
<i>and the proof of origin
of summoning spells...</i>

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.050
<i>However...</i>

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:58.050
<i>I cannot overlook this.</i>

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:01.560
<i>I cannot continue to overlook it!</i>

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:04.060
900 B.C.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:11.730
<i>The king's cruelty...</i>

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:22.240
<i>Despite his gaze resting on such tragedy,</i>

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:26.290
<i>he did nothing but have
a thin smile on his face.</i>

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.120
<i>This...</i>

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.500
<i>demon...</i>

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.670
<i>Despite having a grasp
of everything in this universe,</i>

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.630
<i>the king did absolutely nothing.</i>

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:40.510
<i>He was a king who but smiled.</i>

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:58.360
<i>We all thought
we must not allow this man to be.</i>

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.540
What's wrong?

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:17.170
Even someone like yourself
can lose heart, Caster?

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.970
The Holy Grail War
has ended with our victory.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.970
The victors are given a chance
to have their wishes granted.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.310
I wish for...

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.810
immense wealth.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.310
But what about you?

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.900
What will you wish for?

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.400
"I can wish for anything, Marisbury?"

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:45.030
Oh, of course, my Servant, Caster.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.490
No. Solomon, the King of Mages.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:52.250
Knowing you, your wish
will be a righteous one.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:03.970
Final Singularity
Grand Temple of Time: Solomon

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.350
CHALDEA

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.820
Will the Tuning of the Coffins
make it in time?

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.370
Have you secured the route?

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.700
We barely have a day left.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.450
We're making good progress.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.210
If our calculations are correct...

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:38.210
Chaldea will make contact
with the Final Singularity in four hours.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.590
As long as it's within 72 hours
of the fusion,

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:45.090
we can escape the Singularity
by purging the eastern research wing.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:52.310
And transfer back to Chaldea Observatory's
normal time, December 31, 2016.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:53.600
I see.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.150
Everybody, take one last break, then.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.150
You only have a bit of time,
so do whatever you like.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.740
Do something to refresh and relax a little.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.660
I'll keep an eye on things while you do.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.750
All right, it's time for the final stage.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.830
It's been ten years since I came to Chaldea.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.840
Honestly, this doesn't feel real to me yet.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.970
Is it you? This is unusual.
What's the matter?

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:31.010
Yeah.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.730
I can't really understand
what you're saying.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.230
I may have been able
to understand you back then.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.110
Yeah, I probably did.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.240
Come to think of it, I've spent the last decade
doing nothing but studying and researching.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.660
Once, I had a premonition
that humanity would end.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:58.120
It was one of those bad dreams
people sometimes have.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:01.380
I had no way of denying it,
yet no strength to make sure, either.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:05.470
The only clue I had
was that it would begin at Chaldea.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:10.850
I was filled with a sense of terror,
and I was compelled to do something.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.480
So, I've done everything I possibly could.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:19.060
And I'm about to find out
how this will end.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.440
I'm scared but happy at the same time.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:26.490
I won't have to worry
anymore once this battle's over.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:31.620
I can finally be free to do
what I want with my time.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.250
As for who Solomon really is...

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.880
Well, I suppose I have some idea.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.380
Kingu was a good sample case.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:54.140
If I'm right,
that Solomon has one weak point.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:57.100
Yes, just one.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.730
If he is the real Solomon,

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.020
and at the same time, someone
who's falsely claiming to be the King of Mages...

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.070
There's a void
that Solomon can never reach.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.450
But I...

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:16.080
What I'll be thinking when I take advantage
of that weakness and reach that void...

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.460
That's what scares me.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.930
This feels a bit different
from previous Mystic Codes.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.140
I guess it feels heavier.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:37.890
Right.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:43.100
That one isn't like what we've used previously,
which were explicitly to keep you alive.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:47.820
Your equipment prioritized your safety
first and foremost until now.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.200
After all, you are our only Master.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:55.580
We weren't allowed to let you die
in the middle of the First to Seventh Singularities.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.700
Even if everyone
in the destinations were to die,

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:03.290
we'd keep you alive if nothing else.
That's how we directed you.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.710
But this time, things are different.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.050
That is equipment for you to fight.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.010
To make you defeat the enemy...

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:12.590
no matter what you have to sacrifice.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.680
Now, let me explain
how that Mystic Code works.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.860
This is custom-made
with a particular focus on this final phase.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:30.740
This time, Chaldea will be heading
into the Singularity, as well. In other words...

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:35.620
while Chaldea has electricity left,
you'll have physical protection.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:41.500
Simply put, this Mystic Code allows for
Servant summons with only the Master's powers.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:45.750
You'll still need Mash's shield,
but you won't need Leylines or relics.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:51.010
You'll be able to summon Heroic Spirits
that you feel are appropriate for each situation,

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.880
though only for an instant.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.840
You can use the summon
a total of seven times.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:58.260
This will be the ace up your sleeve.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.980
That said, it'd be better
the less you have to use it.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:06.980
I mean, this thing takes your normal nervous
system and uses it as a pseudo-Magical Circuit.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.690
Though it's controlled
with a safety valve...

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.190
the load you put upon your
nervous system won't change.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.110
You will quite literally
take damage from within.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:21.450
Even then, it's possible for you to enter combat
while your brain and heart are still working.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.420
Yeah, I know.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.210
Something like this is insane.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:33.260
Chaldea isn't a military group.
It's nothing more than a research organization.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:37.890
And a group like that shoulders the survival
of humanity and barges into enemy territory?

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.890
Indeed, this truly is insane.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.010
Feel free to complain—

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.180
Thank you, Da Vinci.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.890
Everyone put in everything
they've got up until now.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:49.150
You, everyone in Chaldea, the doctor...

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:52.690
We've been doing this
because we're the only ones left.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:53.650
So, that's why I...

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:57.160
will give my all, as well.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:08.080
And so, there's something I'd like to ask.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.500
It's about Mash, isn't it?

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:12.880
Yes.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:17.380
Her medical exam results were updated
after returning from Mesopotamia.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.140
I'll be blunt.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.100
Her body is at its limit.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.560
She can only participate
in one more major operation.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:36.150
Romani believed that it would be best
not to tell either of you, but...

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.780
I think Mash knows.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.570
I figured.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.530
She is a smart girl.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:46.540
She knows more about herself
than any of us could know about her.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.500
Good morning, Mash.
How are you feeling?

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:58.510
Doctor, what kind of business
do you have this morning?

00:10:58.510 --> 00:10:59.260
Yeah.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.890
As your primary physician,
I need to tell you the truth.

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:09.020
Mash Kyrielight,
your lifespan is nearing its limit.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.900
Just like humanity has no future past 2017...

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.480
you have no future beyond that time.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.900
This has been set
from the very beginning.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:23.070
You're going to die soon.
It has nothing to do with your own will.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.160
It's simply how you were created.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:31.040
Do you find that frustrating? Or sad?
Does it make you feel empty?

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:31.960
Well, I—

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.920
It's terrible. It's truly meaningless.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:40.050
The more time piles on and on,
the more regrets you have.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:43.680
I can only think this planet has the wrong settings
when it comes to the life-forms on this world.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.810
Don't you think so, Mash?

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.850
You are half man-made.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:55.270
You have the right to hate them,
and the duty to reject them.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.940
Human history has no value.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:03.070
All this is no more than the remnants
left behind by humans leading meaningless lives.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.910
You're not Dr. Roman, are you?

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:11.540
Dr. Roman can be pessimistic, anti-social,

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:16.090
and he often says the wrong thing
and gives up.

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:20.420
But he would never deny
any kind of human effort.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:25.550
You only look like him.
You're something else entirely.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.230
<i>Good day, young lady.</i>

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.610
<i>Good to see you're doing well again today.</i>

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:41.070
<i>I'm sure we'll be having
another calm day tomorrow.</i>

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.320
<i>We're finally liberated from death.</i>

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.700
<i>We have finally arrived at eternity.</i>

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:52.460
<i>We're in a supreme state of bliss.</i>

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.130
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:12:57.670 --> 00:13:02.130
<i>The image you show me only frightens me.</i>

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.430
<i>Why does it frighten you?</i>

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:08.100
<i>A promised tomorrow.
A today that lasts forever.</i>

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.390
<i>That should be your salvation.</i>

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.180
<i>You can simply continue living on.</i>

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:18.020
<i>I thought you, of all people,
would understand how wonderful it is.</i>

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:20.940
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:24.530
<i>I know you're concerned about me.</i>

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:28.240
<i>But I must correct you
when you are in the wrong.</i>

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.030
<i>Very well.</i>

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:33.540
<i>I'm interested in the conclusion
you've reached.</i>

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.290
Mash...

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.460
Senpai...

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.800
It's finally that time.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.680
This was where we first met.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.140
Yes. It brings back memories.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.770
I was a rookie who was utterly clueless.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:59.020
But you still became a Servant
for someone like me, Mash.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.780
And I've been together with you
ever since then.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:07.530
Every Singularity, every world,
I was together with you.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.820
But...

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.540
But...

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.790
This time isn't one of those times.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.800
Mash...

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.920
You should stay in Chaldea!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:29.550
Thank you.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:37.190
But that's impossible.
I have exclusively been your Servant.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:44.900
Ever since you took my hand
as the Command Room was collapsing around us.

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:48.950
If you're going to fight,
I want to fight, too.

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:53.910
Even if it shortens the small
amount of time I have left.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.540
So, you know...

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.370
Yes.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:04.500
It's no reason for any extra concern.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:08.050
It's true that unlike others...

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:11.720
I was born and raised
in a special environment.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:15.930
But I don't feel sad about my life so far.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.940
Nothing sad has happened in it.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:29.450
Solomon said that life has no value.
Human history is meaningless.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:33.450
But that's wrong,
and I'll deny it with everything I have.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:37.830
Even if someone's life
is going to be lost and forgotten...

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:41.830
I've learned on my journey
that the lives of every human in history

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.340
are what built the present
we live in now.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:48.670
I have no experience with life's sorrows.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.590
But I know the joys of life.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:55.890
Senpai, the doctor, everyone at Chaldea,

00:15:55.890 --> 00:16:01.060
and all the worlds we've traveled through
have taught me.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:05.480
So, please, let me accompany you
until the end, Master.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.940
To prevent the Incineration of Humanity,
to show the value of human life

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.990
and to retake our future
with our own hands!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.740
I'm sorry.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.950
Let's go, Mash!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:19.700
Right!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:26.590
You, too, Fou.

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:31.300
<i>To all staff members in Chaldea...</i>

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.800
<i>This facility will soon arrive
at the final location of the Grand Order.</i>

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:39.180
<i>Everything happened in 2015.</i>

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.690
<i>Without anything we could do,
everything on Earth was burned down.</i>

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:46.980
<i>Human history was incinerated
and ended as of 2016.</i>

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:52.490
<i>Chaldeas indicated that nobody
would be able to arrive at 2017.</i>

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.200
<i>But...</i>

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:56.410
<i>fortunately, we survived.</i>

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.030
Let's go!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.580
Now, let me explain the mission.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:10.250
This is our destination,
the Final Singularity.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:16.300
The temple of King Solomon, which we decided
to call the "Grand Temple of Time: Solomon."

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.220
Back on land...

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:21.020
the Incineration of Humanity
has been completed in every era.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:25.560
However, this space is in a higher dimension,
severed from the flow of time.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:31.480
That's right. This is 900 B.C.
And it is also A.D. 2016.

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:37.450
If we can defeat King Solomon before
our subjective time reaches the year 2017,

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.490
the Incineration of Humanity
will be dismantled.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:43.700
Chaldea will now begin contact
with the Grand Temple of Time.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.210
We'll touch ground there
with the entire facility.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.960
The mission is quite simple.
We infiltrate the Singularity...

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:55.220
defeat Solomon and return to Chaldea.
And that will end the entire battle.

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:59.600
With the punch line that humanity
and Chaldea are the great winners.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:03.140
That means when we get back,
we all have to celebrate!

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:04.770
- That's right.
- No.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.350
It won't go that smoothly.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.400
This is footage that I just monitored.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.400
That is...

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.150
A Demon God Pillar?

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:19.160
Right. The arms and legs of King Solomon
that showed up in the First to Sixth Singularities.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.660
The 72 Demon God Pillars.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:26.000
You likely won't be able to avoid combat
on your way to the center.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:27.540
Fujimaru...

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:31.670
You're the only Mage
who can exist within a Singularity.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.130
As soon as we land
at the Temple of Time...

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:37.260
we'll provide Magical Energy assistance
to you and Mash.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:41.390
Come to think of it,
this battle began with defeat.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:43.760
With the bands of light
swirling in the heavens,

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:47.890
Solomon wiped out the entirety of mankind
before anyone knew what happened.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:49.900
This is the greatest murder plot
in human history.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:53.770
Solomon's been carefully planning this out
since the year of his death.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:56.240
Fujimaru, Mash...

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:59.160
Please, put an end to his absurd scheme.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.370
Initiating Rayshift program.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.410
The enemy is Solomon, the King of Mages.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:13.920
The mission objectives
are to destroy him and return alive!

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.190
This place is...

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.440
<i>Fujimaru. Mash.</i>

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.700
<i>Are you guys all right?</i>

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:43.570
Yes. Breathing and consciousness
are both good. But...

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.870
it looks like outer space around us.
It makes me feel strange.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:51.120
<i>It just looks that way,
as you're outside of time now.</i>

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.130
<i>When this temple crumbles,
it will return to the void.</i>

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.130
<i>And this is the contact point
you will need to return to.</i>

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:05.600
This is Da Vinci's...

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.270
Yep! A special item just for this occasion!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.480
<i>You're used to driving, right?</i>

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.190
<i>Now, hop on! Hop on!</i>

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.270
<i>Time to start the operation!</i>

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.650
<i>Be careful, both of you!</i>

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:27.410
<i>It's roughly 20 kilometers to the center
of the temple, where we think Solomon is hiding.</i>

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.830
There isn't any interference
from enemy forces for now.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:35.330
Yeah. I don't detect any heat sources, either.
No enemy shadows.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.090
Doctor...

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:40.840
King Solomon was the ruler
of ancient Jerusalem.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:45.090
He's said to be the greatest summoner
in human history.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:49.100
<i>The man was granted
a miracle by God himself.</i>

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.560
Is King Solomon really a Servant?

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:56.440
You're wondering if he remained alive until now
using Magecraft and the miracle?

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:57.820
Yes.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.070
That's not a possibility.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.450
King Solomon's death was clearly recorded.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.660
In the first place,

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:10.290
during his later years, he wasn't the King of Mages
nor did he have the miracle of God.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.040
It's said that King Solomon
abandoned the miracle on his own accord

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.540
and ended his life as the King of Man.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.550
He was given the omnipotent power
of the Ten Rings from God.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:23.510
and used them only once
before returning them to Heaven.

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:27.010
As the King of Man...

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.100
<i>Heat sources detected!</i>

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:39.980
Deploying shield!

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:49.450
Master!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.200
Is that...

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:52.700
a gate?

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:57.210
Master!

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:13.430
Lev Lainur!

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:16.640
Indeed.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:21.320
A technician at Chaldea
and the vanguard sent by the King of Mages.

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:26.900
The traitor who made the final move
for the extinction of you humans.

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:42.750
And a hard worker who was assigned
to the final cleanup right here.

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:46.220
Professor Lev, did you...

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:50.090
Did you come here with an intent
to destroy humanity from the start?

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:53.720
Of course.

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:57.730
Everything is part of a plan
that began in King Solomon's era.

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:01.230
We, whose power was born
of the King of Mages...

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:04.980
survived through the generations
until the designated time.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:08.820
An original Order, handed down
through generations of Mages.

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:12.490
A certain "way of being"
that must be protected absolutely.

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:16.950
The Grand Order.

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:20.580
For Chaldea, it was
for continuing humanity.

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:23.750
While for us, it was
the Incineration of Humanity.

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.210
You kept up such a plan...

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:28.970
for 3,000 years?

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:31.970
That's what Mages are about.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:38.480
I was designated for 2015,
the final assignment.

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:42.230
I'm a seed left behind by Solomon.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:48.490
And at the point where I awakened
as who I really am, your history came to an end.

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:53.120
It was determined that the resources
to collect would end there.

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:53.950
But...

00:23:56.910 --> 00:24:00.330
you Chaldeans insisted on surviving.

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:03.170
Why? Did I miscalculate somewhere?

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:07.840
No, that's not it. It was because an impostor
managed to slip past my watchful gaze.

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:12.260
<i>Am I right, Romani Archaman?</i>

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:19.180
Or maybe you were playing the fool in front of me
so things would turn out the way they have!

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:21.190
If so, that's really a shame!

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:25.270
I thought we were friends!

00:24:31.900 --> 00:24:35.870
There's no way you could've detected
Romani's nature!

00:24:35.870 --> 00:24:43.710
After all, he didn't trust anyone around him
until I was summoned to Chaldea.

00:24:44.420 --> 00:24:46.170
"I don't know the reason."

00:24:46.960 --> 00:24:49.420
"I don't even know who the enemies are."

00:24:49.460 --> 00:24:52.170
"There's no guarantee...

00:24:52.970 --> 00:24:54.640
that it's even going to happen."

00:24:56.680 --> 00:25:01.890
He threw his entire life away,
believing in the crisis of mankind.

00:25:02.180 --> 00:25:05.900
That's how Romani Archaman spent a decade.

00:25:06.190 --> 00:25:10.190
In a hell of his own creation,
where he couldn't rest even for a moment.

00:25:10.530 --> 00:25:15.860
Such a man would never show
his true nature, even to a friend!

00:25:23.830 --> 00:25:28.670
Of course, I kept an eye
on his suspicious behavior.

00:25:28.670 --> 00:25:33.630
That's why I made a move to kill him
with the Command Room explosion.

00:25:36.470 --> 00:25:39.350
Our king is tied up right now.

00:25:39.970 --> 00:25:43.480
I'll tidy up my own loose ends right here.

00:25:50.360 --> 00:25:52.940
My name is Demon God Flauros,

00:25:52.940 --> 00:25:57.280
one of the 72 Demon Gods!
The one who governs information!

00:26:02.040 --> 00:26:06.500
I'll enjoy seeing
how much you've bettered yourselves!

00:26:12.380 --> 00:26:14.840
Enemy unit confirmed as a Demon God Pillar!

00:26:16.590 --> 00:26:21.220
The path to the center of the temple
is believed to be that gate, Master!

00:26:22.260 --> 00:26:23.970
Yeah, we'll break through here, Mash!

00:26:33.530 --> 00:26:34.150
Mash!

00:26:36.900 --> 00:26:38.410
From here on out...

00:26:39.240 --> 00:26:40.910
support him instead of me!

00:26:45.660 --> 00:26:46.960
<i>Heed my words!</i>

00:26:52.130 --> 00:26:56.300
<i>My will creates your body,
and your sword creates my destiny!</i>

00:26:56.720 --> 00:27:00.680
<i>If you heed the Grail's call,
then follow humanity's path and answer me!</i>

00:27:01.600 --> 00:27:04.930
<i>Seventh Heaven clad
in the great words of stargazers...</i>

00:27:08.640 --> 00:27:11.230
<i>Come forth, pass on your judgment,
and punish my enemies...</i>

00:27:12.020 --> 00:27:13.730
<i>Guardian of the Scales!</i>

00:27:21.410 --> 00:27:22.570
This is...

00:27:33.090 --> 00:27:35.710
My name is Alexander III!

00:27:35.710 --> 00:27:39.260
From the bonds of reminiscence,
I will assist in this battle!

00:27:39.510 --> 00:27:41.720
Go, Bucephalus!

00:27:43.100 --> 00:27:45.430
Summons? Right here, right now?

00:27:49.020 --> 00:27:54.110
A Mystic Code allowing simple summons
by using up the wearer's nervous system...

00:27:54.110 --> 00:27:56.900
But an overworked system
has a weakness!

00:28:01.360 --> 00:28:02.990
That's quite the trick!

00:28:21.130 --> 00:28:22.550
<i>Bucephalus!</i>

00:28:43.530 --> 00:28:47.450
But you were too stingy!
This is what happens with only one of them!

00:28:59.300 --> 00:29:02.050
No matter what scheme
you have up your sleeve, it's useless!

00:29:02.590 --> 00:29:03.590
Begone!

00:29:07.760 --> 00:29:11.480
<i>O cloud of darkness!
O lightning! O father! Behold!</i>

00:29:11.980 --> 00:29:13.060
<i>Bucephalus!</i>

00:29:16.810 --> 00:29:19.360
With only this much firepower...

00:29:30.620 --> 00:29:35.040
<i>Hell incarnate is the reward
for your depravity!</i>

00:29:41.710 --> 00:29:43.970
You brat!

00:29:45.800 --> 00:29:47.720
<i>Kazikli...</i>

00:29:48.300 --> 00:29:49.390
<i>Bey!</i>

00:30:05.860 --> 00:30:06.660
What?

00:30:06.950 --> 00:30:09.450
Is this what you call a "Noble Phantasm"?

00:30:09.450 --> 00:30:11.950
Great! Do as you wish!

00:30:16.500 --> 00:30:19.040
<i>La Mort Espoir.</i>

00:30:20.090 --> 00:30:22.170
Execution complete.

00:30:30.220 --> 00:30:31.890
Lev Lainur...

00:30:32.430 --> 00:30:35.980
confirmed the disappearance
of Professor Lev.

00:30:43.320 --> 00:30:45.610
Master, are you okay?

00:30:45.940 --> 00:30:47.400
Of course.

00:30:47.400 --> 00:30:49.610
Though, my legs are a bit numb.

00:30:49.950 --> 00:30:51.370
But it's over now.

00:30:52.240 --> 00:30:54.240
We need to hurry to the gate.

00:30:54.950 --> 00:30:56.750
Let's go, Mash.

00:30:57.250 --> 00:30:59.710
You're being too hasty.

00:31:02.880 --> 00:31:06.840
<i>Congratulations on your victory
after using three of the aces up your sleeve!</i>

00:31:06.840 --> 00:31:10.720
It angered me from the bottom of my heart,
but I will give credit where credit is due.

00:31:11.850 --> 00:31:14.850
How you have grown, Ritsuka Fujimaru!

00:31:15.470 --> 00:31:18.310
But it's meaningless.
It is all meaningless.

00:31:18.310 --> 00:31:20.850
We are inexhaustible.

00:31:21.150 --> 00:31:24.480
Now, come, my kindred!

00:31:26.440 --> 00:31:28.610
The Demon God Pillar has been restored!

00:31:28.950 --> 00:31:30.070
No, wait, this is...

00:31:30.530 --> 00:31:35.910
That's right. We are this space itself
as well as the temple itself.

00:31:36.750 --> 00:31:42.380
The 72 Demon God Pillars is not symbolic
of individuals but our entire existence.

00:31:42.380 --> 00:31:46.710
There will always be 72 Demon God Pillars,
no matter what you do to us.

00:31:49.930 --> 00:31:52.720
Do you not understand, Fujimaru?

00:31:52.720 --> 00:31:59.770
Basically, it means that if you want to kill me,
you'll have to destroy all 72 of us!

00:32:01.770 --> 00:32:04.310
- What's this?
- Something hit us from the outside!

00:32:04.310 --> 00:32:07.030
The second reactive theory unit
has sustained 60% damage!

00:32:07.530 --> 00:32:10.240
Cut off all power to external facilities!

00:32:14.120 --> 00:32:18.080
Reroute everything to Chaldeas
and the reactive theory units!

00:32:18.080 --> 00:32:20.040
We need to maintain
the Command Room's functions!

00:32:21.670 --> 00:32:24.170
We've lost the northern observation room!

00:32:24.170 --> 00:32:26.800
Detecting excessive pressure
in the observatory dome!

00:32:26.800 --> 00:32:28.340
T-minus five minutes until collapse!

00:32:28.710 --> 00:32:33.430
At this rate, Chaldea will enter foam-state
and be swallowed up by the Temple of Time!

00:32:33.760 --> 00:32:36.260
We'll need to destroy the Singularity
before we're smashed to smithereens!

00:32:36.680 --> 00:32:40.430
We have to destroy all of them
at once to defeat them. But...

00:32:44.400 --> 00:32:45.810
That's impossible!

00:32:46.190 --> 00:32:49.030
Impossible, you hear?

00:32:51.110 --> 00:32:55.530
But what chance do you have of that?
Where is your army?

00:32:55.530 --> 00:32:57.870
That's right, such a thing
doesn't exist anywhere!

00:32:57.870 --> 00:32:59.910
You guys can't get to that level!

00:33:00.500 --> 00:33:04.170
You've merely thrown yourselves
into your own graves!

00:33:08.000 --> 00:33:11.550
First Singularity,
Naberius, the Melting Furnace.

00:33:16.050 --> 00:33:19.640
Second Singularity,
Flauros, the Information Center.

00:33:22.140 --> 00:33:26.020
Third Singularity,
Forneus, the Observatory.

00:33:27.980 --> 00:33:32.110
Fourth Singularity,
Barbatos, the Control Tower.

00:33:32.820 --> 00:33:36.110
Fifth Singularity,
Halphas, the Armory.

00:33:38.990 --> 00:33:42.500
Sixth Singularity,
Amon, the Gazing Star.

00:33:44.290 --> 00:33:48.420
Seventh Singularity,
Sabnock, the Chamber of Life.

00:33:57.260 --> 00:34:03.220
Right! This is that thing called "human history"
you guys are trying to dearly cling onto!

00:34:06.350 --> 00:34:09.230
Ritsuka Fujimaru, the final Master...

00:34:09.230 --> 00:34:12.400
Your fight has been truly amusing!

00:34:12.900 --> 00:34:15.570
You fought all this way,
and it was worthless!

00:34:15.570 --> 00:34:17.610
Your end will be utterly pathetic!

00:34:17.610 --> 00:34:20.700
It's been a spectacular show!

00:34:21.410 --> 00:34:22.740
Thank you...

00:34:22.740 --> 00:34:25.040
<i>and goodbye!</i>

00:34:25.580 --> 00:34:29.920
You shall follow in the footsteps
of the incinerated humanity, Chaldea and all!

00:34:38.090 --> 00:34:39.090
No.

00:34:40.600 --> 00:34:44.100
The ones who stand here right now
are the proof.

00:34:45.020 --> 00:34:50.730
Fragile humans that you Demon Gods mocked
as unnecessary, that they would never reach here...

00:34:53.230 --> 00:34:56.780
Even if all sorts of life
had been incinerated in an instant...

00:34:57.570 --> 00:35:02.030
you looked forward, knowing
our fate has not yet been decided.

00:35:03.790 --> 00:35:05.370
Impossible!

00:35:05.370 --> 00:35:07.500
Impossible! This can't happen!

00:35:38.400 --> 00:35:41.490
Now, lift your heads, Fujimaru and Mash.

00:35:42.700 --> 00:35:49.040
Wasn't this meant to be a story
about us taking back our future together?

00:35:49.460 --> 00:35:51.880
A-Are my sensors broken?

00:35:51.880 --> 00:35:54.460
There are summoning spells all over!

00:35:54.750 --> 00:35:59.840
Ten, twenty, thirty Spirit Origin signatures!
And still increasing!

00:36:00.130 --> 00:36:01.890
Romani, can these be...

00:36:01.890 --> 00:36:03.760
Yeah, they're Servants!

00:36:04.800 --> 00:36:07.810
This is amazing! They just keep coming!

00:36:08.350 --> 00:36:11.140
With no power of the land,
nor a summoning circle,

00:36:11.140 --> 00:36:13.900
all the way to this temple
isolated from human history!

00:36:13.900 --> 00:36:16.360
Following the thin threads of fate
that intertwined when you crossed paths,

00:36:16.360 --> 00:36:18.570
they're manifesting autonomously!

00:36:26.490 --> 00:36:28.790
Something like that cannot be!

00:36:29.290 --> 00:36:32.790
And yet, they are all here to offer aid.

00:36:33.630 --> 00:36:38.880
So they could respond to the actions of one human,
suddenly burdened with the entire world

00:36:38.880 --> 00:36:42.010
and yet made it all the way here
suffering all the while, but never giving up.

00:36:42.340 --> 00:36:43.220
Jeanne!

00:36:56.860 --> 00:37:02.740
Hear me! Heroic Spirits,
mighty warriors who have gathered here!

00:37:03.530 --> 00:37:05.490
Though we may be rivals...

00:37:05.950 --> 00:37:08.660
or from completely different eras,

00:37:08.990 --> 00:37:11.500
we must stand together now!

00:37:15.290 --> 00:37:17.630
My True Name is Jeanne d'Arc!

00:37:17.960 --> 00:37:19.380
In the name of the Lord...

00:37:19.670 --> 00:37:21.460
I shall become your shield!

00:37:24.680 --> 00:37:28.010
<i>O flag of mine, protect our comrades!</i>

00:37:28.430 --> 00:37:29.680
Die!

00:37:29.680 --> 00:37:31.720
<i>Luminosité Eternelle!</i>

00:37:45.280 --> 00:37:46.320
That's...

00:37:46.320 --> 00:37:47.740
Alexander's...

00:37:49.740 --> 00:37:50.490
Fou!

00:37:52.500 --> 00:37:55.210
Leave this to us!

00:37:58.500 --> 00:38:00.920
Melting Furnace, liberated.

00:38:00.920 --> 00:38:03.460
Enemy Servant group supplemented.

00:38:03.460 --> 00:38:05.590
Commencing extermination now.

00:38:22.730 --> 00:38:27.820
You seem to lack courtesy,
arrogant emperors!

00:38:28.740 --> 00:38:29.910
<i>Everything...</i>

00:38:30.160 --> 00:38:32.660
<i>Absolutely everything
leads to my lance!</i>

00:38:33.620 --> 00:38:36.080
<i>Magna Voluisse Magnum!</i>

00:38:36.080 --> 00:38:38.000
Rome!

00:38:46.010 --> 00:38:50.390
If you're seeking an all-out war,
we will respond as such!

00:38:51.260 --> 00:38:53.260
Information Center, in session.

00:38:53.680 --> 00:38:57.770
All of you, without exception,
will be incinerated.

00:39:00.400 --> 00:39:02.020
Notification to all forces.

00:39:02.690 --> 00:39:04.030
Incinerate!

00:39:04.360 --> 00:39:06.030
Incinerate!

00:39:17.750 --> 00:39:19.250
Amazing!

00:39:19.710 --> 00:39:21.330
It's not just Jeanne!

00:39:21.330 --> 00:39:25.710
Emperor Nero, Captain Drake,
Mordred and everyone else...

00:39:26.050 --> 00:39:27.170
They're all fighting!

00:39:27.510 --> 00:39:28.420
Right!

00:39:28.720 --> 00:39:32.720
They're all the folks who've lent us a hand
in the previous Singularities!

00:39:43.860 --> 00:39:45.820
O king... My king...

00:39:46.150 --> 00:39:48.610
Our temple is being invaded.

00:39:49.240 --> 00:39:55.620
We should incinerate those Heroic Spirits
with Ars Almadel Salomonis's bands of light.

00:39:59.250 --> 00:40:02.750
What an ugly sight. Truly ugly to see.

00:40:03.080 --> 00:40:05.920
Do you not think so, Bael?

00:40:09.720 --> 00:40:14.350
Any Heroic Spirit
would have known our purpose.

00:40:14.350 --> 00:40:21.100
The bands of light are the way of balancing
old humanity to reach a better truth.

00:40:21.520 --> 00:40:25.190
But even knowing that,
they still attack us.

00:40:25.190 --> 00:40:26.900
Unbelievable.

00:40:29.440 --> 00:40:32.450
Truly, they are but scum!

00:40:32.450 --> 00:40:36.280
No matter how much humans claim
to have advanced,

00:40:36.280 --> 00:40:38.830
they themselves are the proof
of humanity's limits!

00:40:39.250 --> 00:40:40.750
Why fight?

00:40:41.330 --> 00:40:43.250
Why lend a hand to Chaldea?

00:40:44.080 --> 00:40:49.010
Have you all seen nothing?

00:40:57.180 --> 00:40:59.970
It's finally time, Senpai.

00:41:00.520 --> 00:41:02.980
From the city of Fuyuki to Mesopotamia,

00:41:03.390 --> 00:41:05.480
each path was a perilous one,

00:41:05.480 --> 00:41:07.570
but it was definitely a journey
that's hard to come by.

00:41:08.230 --> 00:41:10.900
The fact that an immature
Servant like myself

00:41:10.900 --> 00:41:15.070
could continue the journey
was all thanks to you, Master.

00:41:15.450 --> 00:41:16.570
Nope.

00:41:17.030 --> 00:41:20.660
It's all because you were here with me, Mash,
that I was able to come all the way here.

00:41:21.450 --> 00:41:25.420
We have one more battle left.
Let's win it and go back to Chaldea!

00:41:34.130 --> 00:41:36.390
Yes, definitely.

00:41:37.260 --> 00:41:39.560
But please don't forget this...

00:41:40.430 --> 00:41:44.980
You were never fighting
to defeat your opponent.

00:41:45.690 --> 00:41:46.730
Mash...

00:41:50.270 --> 00:41:53.280
Many new encounters and many futures...

00:41:54.900 --> 00:41:59.160
Those were the things we've been fighting for!

00:42:03.410 --> 00:42:04.620
Doctor...

00:42:04.620 --> 00:42:06.420
We'll soon enter the fissure in space.

00:42:06.670 --> 00:42:10.170
<i>The center of the temple
is beyond that fissure.</i>

00:42:10.500 --> 00:42:13.050
<i>This will be the last conversation from Chaldea.</i>

00:42:13.550 --> 00:42:14.420
<i>So, Mash...</i>

00:42:15.630 --> 00:42:17.140
<i>I want to ask you...</i>

00:42:17.800 --> 00:42:19.930
<i>Do you have any regrets?</i>

00:42:21.970 --> 00:42:23.350
Of course not, Doctor!

00:42:24.100 --> 00:42:28.400
I will have no regrets, even to the very end!

00:42:29.690 --> 00:42:31.070
<i>I see.</i>

00:42:31.480 --> 00:42:32.900
<i>Then, be on your way.</i>

00:42:33.190 --> 00:42:35.860
<i>I believe in your victory!</i>

00:43:19.030 --> 00:43:22.410
Welcome, Chaldea's Master.

00:43:23.120 --> 00:43:26.410
I am surprised
by your unexpected resistance.

00:43:26.910 --> 00:43:29.080
Solomon, the King of Mages!

00:43:29.080 --> 00:43:30.580
Halt.

00:43:31.000 --> 00:43:35.000
I will allow your presence,
but I have not allowed your audience.

00:43:35.630 --> 00:43:37.550
Why have you come here?

00:43:38.220 --> 00:43:42.850
Why couldn't you have restrained yourselves
for just a few more minutes?

00:43:42.850 --> 00:43:46.140
We were putting the finishing touches
on our Virtual Third Noble Phantasm.

00:43:46.770 --> 00:43:51.400
Why must you appear before
the startup calculation was complete?

00:43:51.810 --> 00:43:53.860
According to the doctor's observations,

00:43:53.860 --> 00:43:57.690
the energy it'd take to exceed
the bands of light doesn't exist on Earth.

00:43:58.190 --> 00:44:04.030
That's what scorched the entire Earth
and incinerated humanity.

00:44:04.330 --> 00:44:09.750
Of course not. Do not tell me
Chaldea's commander can be so blind.

00:44:10.160 --> 00:44:15.920
It is true that these bands of light
could burn the outer layer of this planet.

00:44:15.920 --> 00:44:18.760
But how would I benefit from that?

00:44:19.170 --> 00:44:22.590
You have it backwards, Mash.

00:44:22.590 --> 00:44:27.520
An energy source exceeding
the bands of light doesn't exist on Earth?

00:44:31.440 --> 00:44:32.520
Fool!

00:44:33.060 --> 00:44:35.190
That's exactly right!

00:44:35.520 --> 00:44:38.570
Because it is made of you people!

00:44:38.900 --> 00:44:42.610
I made the Singularities,
fractured the flow of history,

00:44:42.610 --> 00:44:47.290
and reaching from the present into the past,
I was able to wring out nearly limitless energy!

00:44:47.700 --> 00:44:49.790
That is what the bands of light are!

00:44:50.160 --> 00:44:54.290
The heat you looked upon
was this planet's passion!

00:44:54.790 --> 00:44:57.380
It is the vestiges of the people of each era,

00:44:57.380 --> 00:45:02.300
the consolidation of everything,
the very crystallization of human history!

00:45:02.880 --> 00:45:06.010
Your aim wasn't to destroy humanity.

00:45:06.010 --> 00:45:08.560
It was to use humanity as fuel.

00:45:08.560 --> 00:45:12.480
So I can attain the ultimate position.

00:45:12.480 --> 00:45:16.270
If no one can conquer death, then I will!

00:45:16.650 --> 00:45:23.150
And you will die miserably!
Cling to your insignificant lives...

00:45:23.150 --> 00:45:26.660
for the brief moments remaining
before my great task is complete!

00:45:27.120 --> 00:45:28.660
Just who are you...

00:45:29.040 --> 00:45:30.160
Solomon?

00:45:30.620 --> 00:45:32.790
I am Solomon.

00:45:32.790 --> 00:45:35.330
Or at least, this body is.

00:45:35.330 --> 00:45:38.710
The Heroic Spirits' resistance means little.

00:45:38.710 --> 00:45:42.670
If the Master perishes,
every single one of them will leave.

00:45:42.670 --> 00:45:46.300
All of your actions have been for nothing...

00:45:46.640 --> 00:45:48.300
Ritsuka Fujimaru!

00:45:48.300 --> 00:45:50.680
O worst Master of humanity!

00:45:54.980 --> 00:45:55.730
No!

00:45:56.230 --> 00:45:57.230
You're wrong!

00:45:57.860 --> 00:46:02.440
No matter how tough or painful things got,
Senpai always did everything he could!

00:46:02.440 --> 00:46:04.700
He always kept moving forward!

00:46:05.280 --> 00:46:08.370
Ritsuka Fujimaru is the best Master!

00:46:08.910 --> 00:46:10.790
I'll be proof of that!

00:46:11.080 --> 00:46:12.750
I am impressed.

00:46:12.750 --> 00:46:16.830
The Round Table, which King Arthur's
knights supposedly sat around...

00:46:16.830 --> 00:46:21.090
and your impudence
in using even that as a weapon...

00:46:24.090 --> 00:46:26.180
Mash, leave the backup to me!

00:46:26.180 --> 00:46:26.930
Okay!

00:47:04.710 --> 00:47:05.460
Well then...

00:48:00.350 --> 00:48:03.020
I am not an incompetent king.

00:48:03.480 --> 00:48:05.980
Though I declare the human race foolish,

00:48:05.980 --> 00:48:10.150
I value you correctly as strong, fierce creatures.

00:48:10.150 --> 00:48:12.780
As such, I praise you
for putting up a good fight...

00:48:12.780 --> 00:48:16.200
and grant you the honor
of witnessing my true form!

00:48:27.710 --> 00:48:30.550
Bands of light,
illuminate the throne room!

00:48:31.510 --> 00:48:33.800
Let my great feat begin!

00:48:35.640 --> 00:48:38.930
Let this room be filled with our blessing.

00:48:38.930 --> 00:48:43.440
For one of the Beasts of Disaster,
an Evil of Humanity, shall manifest right here.

00:48:44.020 --> 00:48:49.690
Master of Chaldea,
you asked me who I am.

00:48:50.280 --> 00:48:53.950
I existed as Solomon,
the King of Mages.

00:48:54.280 --> 00:48:57.200
I am the system
the King of Mages created.

00:48:57.490 --> 00:49:00.200
I ruled a nation with Solomon

00:49:00.200 --> 00:49:04.330
and was left behind when he died,
as a primordial curse.

00:49:05.670 --> 00:49:11.970
I used Solomon's body as a nest and achieved
incarnation through a summoning spell.

00:49:11.970 --> 00:49:17.510
I am the one who shall attain true wisdom
as was desired of me.

00:49:26.900 --> 00:49:33.400
I am the one who shall devour you
to reach a new height and create a new planet.

00:49:33.400 --> 00:49:38.530
I am the one who shall gather 72 curses
and set flame to all of history.

00:49:38.530 --> 00:49:42.410
I am the Ritual for the Incineration of Humanity.

00:49:42.710 --> 00:49:46.170
I am Goetia, the King of Demon Gods.

00:49:48.250 --> 00:49:49.210
Goetia?

00:49:49.500 --> 00:49:53.170
The generalized term for the Magecraft
supposedly used by King Solomon!

00:49:53.470 --> 00:49:56.590
The prediction and categorization
from Trismegistus are done!

00:49:56.890 --> 00:49:59.560
Spirit Origin structure type, Nega-Hume!

00:49:59.560 --> 00:50:02.060
Spirit Origin Output, Tier Two Planet Class!

00:50:02.680 --> 00:50:04.180
It's Beast I!

00:50:08.310 --> 00:50:11.360
We saw much sadness.

00:50:11.690 --> 00:50:13.940
We saw many betrayals.

00:50:14.530 --> 00:50:16.240
We have seen enough.

00:50:16.570 --> 00:50:21.450
Even the gods can meet no end on this planet
except through annihilation.

00:50:22.700 --> 00:50:24.960
This planet was a mistake.

00:50:24.960 --> 00:50:28.460
It was madness, predicated on life
with a fixed duration.

00:50:29.500 --> 00:50:31.920
I will reach the apex of it all.

00:50:32.420 --> 00:50:35.510
I shall go 4.6 billion years into the past

00:50:35.510 --> 00:50:39.470
and bear witness to the moment
when this celestial body was born,

00:50:39.470 --> 00:50:41.970
and remake this world.

00:50:42.640 --> 00:50:48.230
I shall rewrite the book of Genesis
and create a world without the concept of death.

00:50:48.560 --> 00:50:52.230
That shall be our grand deed.

00:50:52.980 --> 00:50:59.990
To us, humans are just fuel for a propulsion device
that could launch us to the very beginning.

00:50:59.990 --> 00:51:02.870
Remake the planet...

00:51:04.910 --> 00:51:06.250
Now then...

00:51:06.250 --> 00:51:09.080
it is finally time for retaliation.

00:51:10.460 --> 00:51:13.000
We are very busy.

00:51:13.880 --> 00:51:17.260
My true work is still waiting.

00:51:20.050 --> 00:51:21.390
Fool!

00:51:23.140 --> 00:51:25.470
We're the busy ones!

00:51:25.470 --> 00:51:26.730
Emperor Nero!

00:51:26.730 --> 00:51:27.770
Umu!

00:51:27.770 --> 00:51:29.310
Sorry to make you wait, Fujimaru!

00:51:29.940 --> 00:51:33.190
But I'm not the only one
who's raced over here!

00:51:37.490 --> 00:51:38.740
Fine.

00:51:39.070 --> 00:51:42.200
You are unnecessary
on this journey to the apex.

00:51:42.740 --> 00:51:44.370
Welcome, everyone.

00:51:44.700 --> 00:51:46.950
Now die.

00:51:55.630 --> 00:51:56.800
I think not.

00:52:30.750 --> 00:52:33.380
For now, let us believe in them.

00:52:34.500 --> 00:52:36.040
I can keep going for a bit more!

00:52:42.510 --> 00:52:43.680
That's nothing!

00:52:52.310 --> 00:52:53.230
Yo!

00:52:53.810 --> 00:52:55.730
Let's go, you bastard!

00:53:06.030 --> 00:53:06.910
What the—

00:53:11.580 --> 00:53:13.420
Disinfecting! Sterilizing!

00:53:51.950 --> 00:53:55.830
I see. You do show your worth
in making it all the way here.

00:53:55.830 --> 00:54:00.460
Among the Heroic Spirits gathered here,
these must have especially strong bonds with you.

00:54:01.090 --> 00:54:01.960
However,

00:54:02.670 --> 00:54:05.840
that makes it all the more pitiful.

00:54:09.350 --> 00:54:10.600
Begone.

00:54:15.730 --> 00:54:16.770
This is...

00:54:17.350 --> 00:54:20.070
The summoning spell itself
is being destroyed!

00:54:23.280 --> 00:54:28.660
I am the supreme summoning spell
created by you humans.

00:54:29.070 --> 00:54:30.660
As long as you are a Heroic Spirit...

00:54:30.950 --> 00:54:33.660
you cannot surpass me.

00:54:36.080 --> 00:54:37.670
This can't be!

00:54:41.840 --> 00:54:43.130
Now...

00:54:43.130 --> 00:54:46.130
it is time, everyone in Chaldea.

00:54:49.180 --> 00:54:52.220
Deployment of Third Noble Phantasm confirmed.

00:54:52.720 --> 00:54:54.600
It can't be stopped, can it...

00:54:54.930 --> 00:54:56.100
Master?

00:55:04.610 --> 00:55:08.450
Why would you simply accept this,
Mash Kyrielight?

00:55:08.780 --> 00:55:11.530
I have come to understand you.

00:55:11.870 --> 00:55:14.870
Can you not understand me?

00:55:15.500 --> 00:55:19.960
We both know
how utterly meaningless life truly is.

00:55:21.380 --> 00:55:22.840
Isn't that right?

00:55:23.250 --> 00:55:25.630
The future is hollow.

00:55:25.630 --> 00:55:27.590
Humanity is worthless.

00:55:28.050 --> 00:55:30.720
Even alive, they must be
in constant fear of death.

00:55:31.050 --> 00:55:34.220
No matter what, death always comes
for them and separates people.

00:55:34.930 --> 00:55:36.730
I tire of it.

00:55:37.060 --> 00:55:42.110
A world without death should be
exactly what someone like you wishes for.

00:55:44.570 --> 00:55:49.110
We want someone, just a single person,
to understand us.

00:55:49.110 --> 00:55:53.870
If we have even that much,
we can be completely certain in our plan.

00:55:54.740 --> 00:56:01.790
Mash Kyrielight, a life made by man
and one that is about to disappear...

00:56:02.130 --> 00:56:04.630
Join with us in rejecting
all of human history.

00:56:05.300 --> 00:56:08.170
Tell us that we are correct.

00:56:08.510 --> 00:56:11.640
Just say one word. "Yes."

00:56:12.260 --> 00:56:17.850
With your assent, we shall permit you
to journey with us toward the apex.

00:56:19.270 --> 00:56:21.520
Don't you feel the same?

00:56:21.520 --> 00:56:26.690
If you're going to die either way,
shouldn't you at least save Mash?

00:56:27.030 --> 00:56:28.650
That's...

00:56:31.360 --> 00:56:33.030
That's right.

00:56:33.320 --> 00:56:37.040
You've been asking me
the same thing all along.

00:56:37.540 --> 00:56:42.120
It's true that if death is certain,
then life is meaningless.

00:56:42.540 --> 00:56:46.290
I cannot deny that.

00:56:46.920 --> 00:56:47.920
Then...

00:56:49.210 --> 00:56:55.220
But meaning isn't something humans find
in their own lives while they live.

00:56:55.680 --> 00:57:01.310
It's true that a world without death or endings
would be one without sadness.

00:57:01.640 --> 00:57:03.690
But that would be wrong.

00:57:04.020 --> 00:57:05.810
Even if I could live for eternity...

00:57:06.610 --> 00:57:09.320
I wouldn't want to.

00:57:09.690 --> 00:57:14.700
The world I'm seeing
is the one that's right in front of me.

00:57:16.870 --> 00:57:21.000
Even if my life ends
in the blink of an eye,

00:57:21.000 --> 00:57:23.960
I want to see...

00:57:24.580 --> 00:57:26.880
every second I can of this future.

00:57:30.590 --> 00:57:34.220
Senpai, will you hold my hand
one more time?

00:57:34.590 --> 00:57:35.590
Yeah.

00:57:35.970 --> 00:57:37.390
Of course.

00:57:46.100 --> 00:57:50.320
A shame. Then burn to ash
along with this era.

00:58:03.960 --> 00:58:07.000
Leave it to me.
Mash Kyrielight, engaging the enemy!

00:58:07.750 --> 00:58:10.420
You're just getting started, Master!

00:58:10.420 --> 00:58:14.550
Your battle isn't going to end
in a place like this!

00:58:14.550 --> 00:58:16.260
M-Mash!

00:58:16.260 --> 00:58:18.720
<i>Deploy Third Noble Phantasm.</i>

00:58:18.720 --> 00:58:20.850
<i>The Time of Birth Hath Come,</i>

00:58:21.180 --> 00:58:23.770
<i>I Am the Remedy of Eternity.</i>

00:58:24.100 --> 00:58:27.230
<i>Now, burn like the garbage you are.</i>

00:58:27.520 --> 00:58:31.400
<i>Ars Almadel Salomonis.</i>

00:58:33.440 --> 00:58:38.450
<i>That which heals all wounds and grudges...
Our glorious homeland...</i>

00:58:38.450 --> 00:58:39.700
<i>Manifest yourself...</i>

00:58:39.700 --> 00:58:43.290
<i>Lord Camelot!</i>

00:59:12.730 --> 00:59:14.070
Mash!

00:59:15.280 --> 00:59:19.070
I'm glad. This should open up
an opportunity for you, Master.

00:59:20.070 --> 00:59:21.530
Thank you for everything.

00:59:22.330 --> 00:59:26.370
I wanted to pay you back
for everything you gave me.

00:59:26.370 --> 00:59:30.210
That's why I was able to put my own
weakness aside and push ahead, Senpai.

00:59:30.210 --> 00:59:36.050
And now, finally,
I really feel like my life has value!

00:59:36.720 --> 00:59:42.640
Like Captain Drake said,
at the very end, I realized my wish!

00:59:44.010 --> 00:59:45.890
But I regret one thing.

00:59:46.430 --> 00:59:49.060
I was always the one who was protected.

00:59:49.060 --> 00:59:51.150
- Mash...
- So at least once...

00:59:51.610 --> 00:59:53.940
I wanted to be useful to you, Senpai.

00:59:53.940 --> 00:59:55.030
Mash!

01:00:00.410 --> 01:00:03.030
<i>As she blocked the heat
that would pierce the planet...</i>

01:00:03.780 --> 01:00:05.540
<i>she thought...</i>

01:00:06.160 --> 01:00:10.290
<i>She thought of the journey so far
and the journey to come.</i>

01:00:10.580 --> 01:00:15.880
<i>She thought of her past,
and of the future she would not be there for.</i>

01:00:18.880 --> 01:00:19.800
<i>That's right.</i>

01:00:20.340 --> 01:00:23.010
<i>Even after all those battles,</i>

01:00:23.350 --> 01:00:27.390
<i>it still was not nearly enough for her.</i>

01:00:30.440 --> 01:00:38.400
<i>That was how strong her gratitude toward
that someone who held her hand was.</i>

01:00:39.030 --> 01:00:44.950
<i>Even if it all started with a simple,
insignificant opportunity.</i>

01:00:45.370 --> 01:00:48.330
<i>She was always protected by you,</i>

01:00:48.330 --> 01:00:51.960
<i>and she was able to fight
because you were there.</i>

01:00:52.830 --> 01:00:54.290
<i>Behold the result.</i>

01:00:54.290 --> 01:00:58.090
<i>Her body could not take the heat
from the bands of light and evaporated.</i>

01:00:58.920 --> 01:01:02.430
<i>But her heart remained untouched,</i>

01:01:02.430 --> 01:01:08.220
<i>and her snowflake shield remained unscathed
as it protected her heart to the end.</i>

01:01:09.020 --> 01:01:16.230
<i>That's why I say that she was neither
a brave warrior nor the protagonist of the story.</i>

01:01:16.610 --> 01:01:21.240
<i>In the end, she was simply an ordinary girl.</i>

01:01:47.220 --> 01:01:51.770
Yes. I suppose I should give you
one last chance to strike at me.

01:01:52.060 --> 01:01:54.730
At the very least,
I understand how you feel.

01:01:54.730 --> 01:02:00.280
Strike me with those
frail human fists of yours and then die.

01:02:01.610 --> 01:02:03.990
Nothing would make me happier!

01:02:08.030 --> 01:02:08.910
Wait.

01:02:09.280 --> 01:02:11.950
Calm yourself a little, Fujimaru.

01:02:13.370 --> 01:02:15.460
A suicidal move isn't your style.

01:02:15.870 --> 01:02:19.040
Try to save your strength for now.

01:02:23.720 --> 01:02:26.430
The final logic barrier is down!

01:02:26.430 --> 01:02:29.220
The Demon God Pillars are invading Chaldea!

01:02:29.220 --> 01:02:30.560
Seal all bulkheads!

01:02:30.850 --> 01:02:34.430
I'll declare Plan A to be the abandonment
of the Command Room! Prepare for evacuation!

01:02:34.430 --> 01:02:37.350
Abandoning the Command Room
would lead to the Coffins shutting down!

01:02:37.770 --> 01:02:40.820
Mash Kyrielight defended him
with her very life!

01:02:40.820 --> 01:02:44.360
We can't give up
on Master Fujimaru's return!

01:02:44.690 --> 01:02:47.860
Yeah. At this point,
we'll just have to struggle until the end.

01:02:48.320 --> 01:02:49.570
Romani?

01:02:49.990 --> 01:02:51.870
A meaningful future, huh?

01:02:52.370 --> 01:02:58.080
Mash, if that's how you feel,
I'll have to make my stand, too.

01:02:59.040 --> 01:03:00.290
Huh.

01:03:00.630 --> 01:03:02.710
So, this is how it's going down, after all?

01:03:04.090 --> 01:03:07.430
It's your job to defend
the Command Room...

01:03:07.930 --> 01:03:09.090
Leonardo.

01:03:09.430 --> 01:03:12.810
I want you to hold out until Fujimaru returns.

01:03:13.470 --> 01:03:16.310
You can do it.
You're a genius, after all.

01:03:16.980 --> 01:03:18.270
Of course.

01:03:20.480 --> 01:03:23.190
I won't be expecting any souvenirs, either.

01:03:24.650 --> 01:03:25.940
Doctor?

01:03:26.860 --> 01:03:28.070
How?

01:03:28.610 --> 01:03:31.780
If you don't have Rayshift aptitude,
this place isn't...

01:03:32.120 --> 01:03:34.700
Romani Archaman?

01:03:37.620 --> 01:03:40.710
You... That Spirit Origin?

01:03:41.040 --> 01:03:44.800
I hate to steal your thunder
here at the end, though.

01:03:45.670 --> 01:03:48.050
The tenth ring...

01:03:48.380 --> 01:03:49.760
No!

01:03:50.050 --> 01:03:51.510
You can't be!

01:03:51.890 --> 01:03:55.520
Yeah. It was just 11 years ago.

01:03:56.520 --> 01:04:00.270
When the previous head of Chaldea,
Marisbury Animusphere...

01:04:00.650 --> 01:04:06.650
joined the Holy Grail War,
he prepared the greatest catalyst possible...

01:04:07.360 --> 01:04:09.360
this ring.

01:04:09.820 --> 01:04:14.450
King Solomon sent it into the distant future
at the time of his death.

01:04:14.830 --> 01:04:18.710
That was Solomon. The very first
Heroic Spirit summoned by Chaldea.

01:04:19.250 --> 01:04:25.090
Alongside Marisbury, he obtained the Grail
and had his wish granted.

01:04:25.880 --> 01:04:27.840
"I want to be human."

01:04:28.130 --> 01:04:32.590
His wish was a very ordinary one.

01:04:32.930 --> 01:04:35.310
Impossible! Absurd!

01:04:35.310 --> 01:04:37.770
You can't be him!

01:04:37.770 --> 01:04:40.190
That man had no wishes!

01:04:40.520 --> 01:04:43.730
He was inhuman! Cold!
Cruel! Emotionless!

01:04:43.730 --> 01:04:46.690
Such a man could not have possessed
an ordinary wish!

01:04:47.110 --> 01:04:50.900
Hearing that from you really stings.

01:04:50.900 --> 01:04:53.620
You hate me a little too much.

01:04:54.120 --> 01:04:57.370
Anyway, Solomon's wish was granted.

01:04:57.370 --> 01:04:59.250
But there was a problem.

01:05:01.580 --> 01:05:06.210
Solomon possessed the skill Clairvoyance. In fact,
his was so potent that it was essentially omniscience.

01:05:06.790 --> 01:05:11.050
When he became human,
he lost all those powers.

01:05:11.380 --> 01:05:13.720
That wasn't a big problem on its own, but...

01:05:14.470 --> 01:05:17.720
just before his power left him, he saw it.

01:05:17.720 --> 01:05:20.100
The end of mankind.

01:05:20.640 --> 01:05:25.230
But who? How? For what purpose?

01:05:25.560 --> 01:05:29.280
And how could it be prevented?

01:05:29.610 --> 01:05:33.320
He lost power of knowing those.

01:05:34.660 --> 01:05:38.370
But he couldn't just ignore it.

01:05:38.870 --> 01:05:41.540
And that's how my journey began.

01:05:42.210 --> 01:05:44.040
I didn't know who the enemy was.

01:05:44.710 --> 01:05:48.920
The only thing I could do
was prepare for when the time came.

01:05:49.210 --> 01:05:52.170
Of course, a few instances of good fortune
helped me along the way.

01:05:52.920 --> 01:05:59.970
The greatest of them was you, Fujimaru.
And I don't just mean on the day we met.

01:06:00.850 --> 01:06:05.230
During this entire Grand Order, there was
never a time you weren't there to help me.

01:06:05.230 --> 01:06:08.270
What the... You, too, Doctor? What are you—

01:06:14.990 --> 01:06:17.490
I am Solomon, the King of Mages.

01:06:18.780 --> 01:06:20.370
Goetia...

01:06:20.370 --> 01:06:23.540
It is I who shall read you your last rites.

01:06:27.790 --> 01:06:34.050
Now that it's already over,
mankind's greatest fool makes an appearance!

01:06:35.010 --> 01:06:37.050
All life must come to an end.

01:06:37.050 --> 01:06:40.640
Life is a pilgrimage
in which we stockpile suffering.

01:06:40.640 --> 01:06:45.060
However, that is by no means
a tale of death and partings.

01:06:45.810 --> 01:06:51.770
Goetia, shame of my years,
Beast born of my corpse...

01:06:51.770 --> 01:06:55.900
Here and now, I will pass judgment
on your evil with my own hands.

01:06:56.860 --> 01:06:59.820
Ha! Don't make me laugh!

01:07:04.620 --> 01:07:06.620
You can't do anything!

01:07:06.620 --> 01:07:08.630
Die! Die!

01:07:08.630 --> 01:07:12.550
I will send you to your death
with your own Noble Phantasm!

01:07:12.550 --> 01:07:13.380
Yeah.

01:07:13.710 --> 01:07:15.670
That's the plan.

01:07:15.670 --> 01:07:18.550
I will be extinguished
by my own Noble Phantasm.

01:07:18.550 --> 01:07:19.800
What?

01:07:20.140 --> 01:07:25.390
For a time in the distant future
when Magecraft turns into an evil against humans,

01:07:25.390 --> 01:07:29.600
Solomon prepared
a safety device to destroy it.

01:07:29.600 --> 01:07:31.690
That is the True First Noble Phantasm.

01:07:31.690 --> 01:07:33.190
What are you talking...

01:07:33.650 --> 01:07:36.860
And now, with all the rings here...

01:07:37.700 --> 01:07:38.860
Goetia...

01:07:38.860 --> 01:07:41.740
You were a spell
woven to watch over mankind

01:07:41.740 --> 01:07:45.120
and in turn, chose to destroy its future.

01:07:45.910 --> 01:07:48.460
Let me teach you the final Magecraft.

01:07:49.670 --> 01:07:51.040
You don't mean...

01:07:51.040 --> 01:07:53.500
No, that's impossible!

01:07:56.760 --> 01:07:57.630
Stop!

01:07:57.970 --> 01:07:59.760
Stop! Stop! Stop!

01:08:00.430 --> 01:08:04.930
These rings, the omnipotent seals,
are no longer yours alone!

01:08:05.430 --> 01:08:10.400
<i>The Time of Birth Hath Come,
I Am the Remedy of Eternity.</i>

01:08:10.900 --> 01:08:15.690
<i>The Time of Coronation Hath Come,
I Am the Beginning of Eternity.</i>

01:08:15.690 --> 01:08:16.530
And now...

01:08:16.530 --> 01:08:20.740
Stop!

01:08:29.500 --> 01:08:31.460
<i>The Time of Parting Hath Come...</i>

01:08:31.790 --> 01:08:34.500
<i>I Am He Who Surrenders the World...</i>

01:08:34.920 --> 01:08:36.500
<i>Ars Nova.</i>

01:08:38.510 --> 01:08:42.760
O Heavenly Father,
I return to you your blessings.

01:08:42.760 --> 01:08:45.350
Omnipotence is too much
for humans to handle.

01:08:45.350 --> 01:08:48.890
My work shall be done
within the limitations of mankind.

01:08:56.940 --> 01:08:59.070
Why? Why?

01:08:59.360 --> 01:09:02.780
After all this time, are you saying
you're going to save the humans, Solomon?

01:09:02.780 --> 01:09:07.080
You, the one who didn't do anything
despite witnessing countless tragedies!

01:09:07.410 --> 01:09:10.370
Yeah, it's strange.

01:09:10.790 --> 01:09:16.960
We saw the same things, sat on the same throne
and spent the same time together.

01:09:17.420 --> 01:09:21.880
But you and I reached
completely antithetical conclusions.

01:09:22.300 --> 01:09:24.590
If there was a difference between us...

01:09:25.050 --> 01:09:26.350
it would be...

01:09:26.680 --> 01:09:30.350
To put it simply, I just didn't have
the freedom to get mad.

01:09:30.350 --> 01:09:31.980
What...

01:09:32.690 --> 01:09:37.150
I've completely cast aside
my position as a Heroic Spirit.

01:09:37.480 --> 01:09:41.740
But Solomon will disappear
from the Throne of Heroes from here on.

01:09:42.150 --> 01:09:45.740
With the complete annihilation
of Solomon, the King of Mages...

01:09:46.490 --> 01:09:49.490
the Age of Gods
will truly come to an end.

01:09:50.910 --> 01:09:54.750
You're going to go away?

01:09:55.250 --> 01:10:00.000
It's scary and sad,
but it was something only I could do.

01:10:00.460 --> 01:10:03.630
And since that's the case,
I have to do it, no matter how painful.

01:10:04.180 --> 01:10:05.640
This is the right thing to do.

01:10:05.970 --> 01:10:09.890
You and Mash taught me
the right thing to do.

01:10:10.310 --> 01:10:11.600
Why?

01:10:11.600 --> 01:10:13.940
That's so selfish!

01:10:14.560 --> 01:10:16.650
And you didn't tell us about it the whole time!

01:10:16.980 --> 01:10:18.310
Unfair!

01:10:18.860 --> 01:10:21.070
Doctor, that's so unfair!

01:10:21.360 --> 01:10:24.450
No, I suppose it isn't fair.

01:10:24.450 --> 01:10:28.070
Sorry. I was inconsiderate
right to the end.

01:10:28.700 --> 01:10:32.200
But my current self can give a clear answer.

01:10:32.580 --> 01:10:33.580
Goetia...

01:10:34.080 --> 01:10:37.080
You harbored hatred toward
the meaninglessness of life.

01:10:37.080 --> 01:10:39.710
Of course, nothing is eternal...

01:10:40.210 --> 01:10:42.590
and pain awaits us all in the end.

01:10:42.920 --> 01:10:46.680
But that doesn't make life
a story of despair. Not at all.

01:10:47.300 --> 01:10:52.060
It's a fight against death and separation
in what precious little time one is given.

01:10:52.060 --> 01:10:56.060
It's a repetition of meeting and parting
despite knowing there's an end.

01:10:56.890 --> 01:11:01.320
Humans' stories are dazzling, brief journeys,
like the twinkling of the stars.

01:11:02.650 --> 01:11:03.990
They are...

01:11:04.940 --> 01:11:07.990
stories of love and hope.

01:11:15.120 --> 01:11:18.080
Can I trust you with the rest, Fujimaru?

01:11:18.420 --> 01:11:24.550
You, the first and only Master in Chaldea
where we spent time together?

01:11:26.130 --> 01:11:27.550
Sure!

01:11:29.970 --> 01:11:31.800
Good answer.

01:11:35.930 --> 01:11:40.650
You really have matured
into a trustworthy Master.

01:11:45.900 --> 01:11:49.320
I'm heading out now, Doctor.

01:11:52.530 --> 01:11:55.580
You relied on others until the very end.

01:11:56.790 --> 01:12:01.080
Your deception will not sway us.

01:12:01.080 --> 01:12:05.760
Our great deed remains incomplete
but unhindered.

01:12:06.340 --> 01:12:09.430
Life should not be bound by death.

01:12:09.430 --> 01:12:14.350
A story that must end like that
is worthless to me.

01:12:14.350 --> 01:12:17.350
Ultimately, I am victorious!

01:12:17.350 --> 01:12:21.730
What can a Master with no Servant do?

01:12:26.320 --> 01:12:27.740
I can do this...

01:12:28.530 --> 01:12:31.240
Several millennia passed
since the world of Primates was set.

01:12:31.700 --> 01:12:34.990
The Age of Gods has ended,
and through time,

01:12:34.990 --> 01:12:38.200
mankind has become
the most prosperous beings on Earth.

01:12:38.500 --> 01:12:43.130
And so we shape the future of this planet
and inscribe its history on the surface.

01:12:43.880 --> 01:12:48.710
For that, we nurtured knowledge,
produced many resources...

01:12:48.710 --> 01:12:51.300
and saw countless lives reincarnated.

01:12:51.630 --> 01:12:59.390
It's a map to prolong mankind's survival
and to ensure its everlasting prosperity!

01:13:00.060 --> 01:13:03.650
In the world of Magecraft,
this is called "humanity"!

01:13:03.940 --> 01:13:08.030
Those of Chaldea
have been charged to protect it!

01:13:09.610 --> 01:13:11.860
I am Ritsuka Fujimaru!

01:13:12.610 --> 01:13:14.320
So many people helped me...

01:13:16.950 --> 01:13:20.000
and here I stand
on behalf of so many others...

01:13:21.870 --> 01:13:23.420
as the Master of Chaldea!

01:13:29.590 --> 01:13:30.920
I challenge you...

01:13:32.300 --> 01:13:35.050
Goetia!

01:13:35.390 --> 01:13:38.470
Then come at me, Chaldea!

01:13:44.190 --> 01:13:48.940
Begone, human history!

01:13:49.400 --> 01:13:53.450
We 72 Demon Gods
shall grind you to dust!

01:14:09.920 --> 01:14:13.550
Just one!
You only need to kill one!

01:15:16.860 --> 01:15:17.740
Why?

01:15:18.110 --> 01:15:19.620
Why? Why?

01:15:19.620 --> 01:15:23.740
Why do you fight so hard
to protect humanity, Heroic Spirits?

01:15:23.740 --> 01:15:27.920
You should be aware
that mankind is not worth this effort!

01:15:37.630 --> 01:15:39.720
This world is madness!

01:15:39.720 --> 01:15:41.760
You are all mad!

01:15:41.760 --> 01:15:45.270
Why should this all hold such value to you?

01:15:54.650 --> 01:15:55.650
Just one!

01:15:55.940 --> 01:15:57.780
By killing just one human...

01:15:58.240 --> 01:16:00.160
everything will be resolved!

01:16:00.450 --> 01:16:01.740
And yet...

01:16:02.030 --> 01:16:03.330
why?

01:16:44.160 --> 01:16:45.370
Fine.

01:16:45.870 --> 01:16:48.370
It pains me to ask this, but I must know!

01:16:49.500 --> 01:16:50.750
Why...

01:16:50.750 --> 01:16:52.830
do you fight?

01:16:56.800 --> 01:16:59.470
Why do you not submit to me?

01:16:59.470 --> 01:17:02.970
Why do you keep fighting so hard?

01:17:07.140 --> 01:17:09.020
<i>But please don't forget this...</i>

01:17:09.350 --> 01:17:12.440
<i>Many new encounters and many futures...</i>

01:17:12.440 --> 01:17:14.100
<i>Those were the things...</i>

01:17:14.400 --> 01:17:16.480
<i>we were fighting for!</i>

01:17:26.160 --> 01:17:27.660
That's obvious.

01:17:31.660 --> 01:17:33.290
To live!

01:18:07.450 --> 01:18:09.660
I see.

01:18:11.450 --> 01:18:15.370
So you weren't even protecting humanity.

01:18:15.960 --> 01:18:19.130
Then we were mistaken.

01:18:19.500 --> 01:18:22.130
We completely overestimated you.

01:18:22.920 --> 01:18:25.880
You longed for life and feared death.

01:18:25.880 --> 01:18:31.310
And while fearing death,
you defeated us in our quest for eternity.

01:18:31.310 --> 01:18:34.940
What hopeless foolishness.

01:18:34.940 --> 01:18:38.610
What worthless stubbornness.
We need not save you.

01:18:54.000 --> 01:18:55.250
I have to get back.

01:19:07.050 --> 01:19:10.680
Goetia, the Beast that knew no love.

01:19:10.680 --> 01:19:14.270
An Evil of Humanity fueled only by his own grief.
One who sought nothingness.

01:19:14.930 --> 01:19:19.650
It's ironic. The Evils of Humanity themselves
represent a love for the human race.

01:19:19.650 --> 01:19:24.650
Wishing for a better future was the threat.

01:19:25.280 --> 01:19:29.660
Destruction of the central area of the temple
and life signals in each location have been confirmed!

01:19:29.660 --> 01:19:30.820
In other words?

01:19:30.820 --> 01:19:34.790
We have confirmed Beast I is gone
and that the Temple of Time is collapsing!

01:19:34.790 --> 01:19:38.920
All right! We'll immediately raise anchor
from this location and withdraw!

01:19:38.920 --> 01:19:41.630
We'll retrieve Fujimaru
as soon as communication returns!

01:19:56.730 --> 01:19:58.980
<i>...jimaru! Fujimaru!</i>

01:19:59.980 --> 01:20:02.150
<i>Can you hear me, Fujimaru?</i>

01:20:02.150 --> 01:20:03.860
<i>We'll send you the coordinates!</i>

01:20:11.370 --> 01:20:12.870
I'm going back...

01:20:13.370 --> 01:20:14.830
to Chaldea.

01:20:46.320 --> 01:20:50.530
No matter what I do here, now,
I cannot redeem my failure.

01:20:51.030 --> 01:20:52.660
This is a meaningless battle.

01:20:52.990 --> 01:20:56.370
This would have been
an unthinkable choice for me before.

01:20:56.830 --> 01:20:57.910
But...

01:20:58.200 --> 01:21:01.290
Now you have a reason to fight.

01:21:01.580 --> 01:21:04.960
Yes, indeed. I also have my pride.

01:21:04.960 --> 01:21:08.300
Or rather, I do now.
I now understand...

01:21:08.800 --> 01:21:15.970
human mentality. Now that I have
a limited and mortal life, I finally understand.

01:21:28.940 --> 01:21:32.280
<i>It's been a long journey. So very long.</i>

01:21:32.280 --> 01:21:37.080
<i>I have dwelt here for 3,000 years.</i>

01:21:37.080 --> 01:21:42.160
<i>I'm going to stop you in order to protect
the one thing I cannot possibly relinquish.</i>

01:21:42.160 --> 01:21:47.670
<i>And you're going to stop me as soon as possible
so you can return home alive.</i>

01:21:47.670 --> 01:21:51.130
<i>O Master who overcame
seven Singularities in seven worlds...</i>

01:21:51.130 --> 01:21:55.680
<i>Your Grand Order is all about
the Incineration of Humanity.</i>

01:21:56.180 --> 01:21:58.640
<i>My name is Goetia.</i>

01:21:58.640 --> 01:22:02.600
<i>I am the one who used humanity
to destroy humanity.</i>

01:22:02.980 --> 01:22:07.230
<i>I am born now and I shall perish now.</i>

01:22:07.650 --> 01:22:11.650
<i>This battle may be
without resolution or reward,</i>

01:22:11.650 --> 01:22:15.320
<i>but I shall put my entire being
on the line to crush you!</i>

01:22:15.740 --> 01:22:20.290
<i>My sworn enemy.
My hatred. My destiny.</i>

01:22:20.290 --> 01:22:22.580
<i>I want you to witness this.</i>

01:22:22.580 --> 01:22:27.170
<i>This brief moment is now my story.</i>

01:22:27.170 --> 01:22:38.010
<i>This brief but precious time has given
the creature called "Goetia" true life.</i>

01:22:53.240 --> 01:22:54.990
Tragically short...

01:22:55.400 --> 01:22:57.990
So, this is what human life is...

01:22:58.530 --> 01:23:02.790
O Lord, may you rejoice in this life.

01:23:23.520 --> 01:23:27.350
Dammit. I was so close.

01:23:41.450 --> 01:23:42.700
Senpai!

01:23:43.240 --> 01:23:44.370
Senpai!

01:23:44.950 --> 01:23:46.290
Grab my hand!

01:24:40.470 --> 01:24:43.600
I'm really glad you're okay, Senpai.

01:24:43.600 --> 01:24:46.310
I was worried
because you weren't waking up.

01:24:46.310 --> 01:24:47.640
Thanks.

01:24:48.390 --> 01:24:50.230
But Mash, how did you...

01:24:50.560 --> 01:24:54.020
Well, I really don't know.

01:24:54.360 --> 01:24:56.530
Fou, do you know anything?

01:25:12.790 --> 01:25:15.210
Master Fujimaru, Mash...

01:25:15.210 --> 01:25:20.510
With your safe return, I'm pleased
to declare our final Grand Order complete!

01:25:20.880 --> 01:25:24.890
Congratulations on completing your mission!
You really did a great job!

01:25:25.640 --> 01:25:26.760
- Yes!
- Yes!

01:25:33.770 --> 01:25:38.280
Now, we have so many things to do piled up,
like communicating with the outside world.

01:25:38.280 --> 01:25:42.780
So, I'd like you two
to set up a communication device.

01:25:43.070 --> 01:25:47.530
And go see for yourselves
what you two have reclaimed.

01:25:47.530 --> 01:25:50.500
Okay! Mission received!

01:25:50.500 --> 01:25:52.080
Let's go, Senpai!

01:25:52.080 --> 01:25:54.040
Huh? S-Sure.

01:25:57.290 --> 01:25:59.840
A notification to all Chaldea staff.

01:25:59.840 --> 01:26:04.840
As of this moment, the Grand Order
has been completed with its objectives met.

01:26:04.840 --> 01:26:08.180
This great feat was possible
thanks to all of your efforts.

01:26:08.180 --> 01:26:10.770
We applaud those achievements.

01:26:11.310 --> 01:26:16.150
However, please remember the sacrifices
that are in the shadows of such achievements.

01:26:16.150 --> 01:26:20.820
Lev Lainur's assault claimed
the lives of two hundred of Chaldea's staff.

01:26:20.820 --> 01:26:24.110
47 Masters are still frozen
in the preservation chambers.

01:26:24.110 --> 01:26:27.570
And one of our people did not return
from the Final Singularity.

01:26:27.570 --> 01:26:30.830
Each of those lost is someone
who cannot ever be replaced.

01:26:31.240 --> 01:26:33.370
What they wanted to achieve...

01:26:33.370 --> 01:26:35.580
What they should have achieved...

01:26:35.580 --> 01:26:39.840
If possible, please give thought
to what they were, and carry on their torch.

01:26:40.380 --> 01:26:42.840
We have fought for that purpose.

01:26:43.220 --> 01:26:44.590
They...

01:26:44.590 --> 01:26:50.640
We all wanted to take back
such things as a part of mankind.

01:27:00.400 --> 01:27:03.070
It's so blue.

01:27:07.820 --> 01:27:11.830
So, this is the real sky.

01:27:12.120 --> 01:27:15.500
The Earth of our own time.

01:27:15.830 --> 01:27:18.830
The doctor told me once.

01:27:18.830 --> 01:27:21.750
He told me it's always snowing
outside Chaldea,

01:27:21.750 --> 01:27:26.220
but once in a while the skies clear,
and you can see the beautiful stars.

01:27:26.550 --> 01:27:27.970
The doctor did?

01:27:27.970 --> 01:27:32.600
Yes! He also said that one day, the time
would come when I'd get to see them for myself.

01:27:32.600 --> 01:27:36.060
He had no proof
but laughed when he told me.

01:27:36.390 --> 01:27:39.940
I bet that was
what he dreamed would happen.

01:27:41.150 --> 01:27:48.150
I was able to see this sky, thanks to the help
and support of so many people.

01:27:48.700 --> 01:27:52.450
It was a whirlwind of a year.
This Order happened on such a terrifying scale.

01:27:52.450 --> 01:27:55.200
Still, it's been a truly incredible experience.

01:27:55.700 --> 01:28:00.380
What did this journey
mean to you, Senpai?

01:28:00.380 --> 01:28:01.750
Let's see.

01:28:02.170 --> 01:28:04.800
I wasn't a Mage or anything.

01:28:04.800 --> 01:28:09.590
Just a normal human
who just happened to stop by Chaldea.

01:28:10.220 --> 01:28:13.100
But I've done everything I could as a Master.

01:28:13.510 --> 01:28:18.980
To the point where I don't want to forget
anything about this journey, about this life.

01:28:19.440 --> 01:28:22.560
So, I hope you'll still have my back, Mash.

01:28:23.230 --> 01:28:26.860
It seems I still have things
I can do as a Master.

01:28:27.690 --> 01:28:31.820
Yes! Rest assured, my Master!

01:28:33.410 --> 01:28:36.950
<i>So, our journey will still continue.</i>

01:28:36.950 --> 01:28:40.120
<i>And to start, we'll go beyond the horizon ahead.</i>

01:28:40.580 --> 01:28:44.960
<i>Once we've done that,
we'll go further and further beyond.</i>

01:28:45.300 --> 01:28:47.130
<i>That is our...</i>

01:28:47.130 --> 01:28:50.470
<i>Or rather, human nature's order.</i>

01:28:51.260 --> 01:28:54.100
<i>All that worrying and lamenting
about the future...</i>

01:28:54.100 --> 01:28:56.510
<i>It was because we had hope.</i>

01:28:56.890 --> 01:29:00.390
<i>That's why I'm sure there are
many more adventures lying ahead of us.</i>

01:29:00.890 --> 01:29:05.110
<i>Let's go toward that new year
where the unknown awaits us!</i>

01:29:08.110 --> 01:29:14.910
Goodbye, Mash Kyrielight.
My time with all of you, this journey,
has been truly wonderful.

01:29:18.080 --> 01:29:24.920
When the Mage sent me out, he told me,
"Go, experience all the beauty
this world has to offer."
And, well... I have seen truly beautiful things.

01:29:28.090 --> 01:29:34.970
There are some evils that can be defeated
without shedding blood or crossing blades.
That is what has made this possible.
Congratulations to you,
the wonderful people of Chaldea.
You have defeated Beast IV
without so much as a single blow.

01:29:38.060 --> 01:29:44.940
Once I've done this,
I will just be an ordinary Beast.
I don't want you to worry.
Nothing will change for you.
Still, it is a bit of a lonely way to go out.
So I wanted to say goodbye here at the end.

01:32:49.250 --> 01:32:53.460
I hope you don't mind.
Then again, the Mage said
an act of goodwill
was something forced onto others.

01:32:53.750 --> 01:32:58.010
But that is...
what I call a happy ending.

01:33:05.970 --> 01:33:07.600
It's been a decade, huh?

01:33:08.180 --> 01:33:10.350
It went by so fast.

01:33:10.810 --> 01:33:13.900
But it's okay. Fujimaru is here.

01:33:14.520 --> 01:33:18.900
As long as he becomes a good Master,
there was meaning in my time here.

01:33:19.190 --> 01:33:24.200
I could ask for no greater reason
for this human existence.

01:33:24.490 --> 01:33:28.290
It more than makes up
for the freedom I've had.

01:33:29.160 --> 01:33:30.160
It's time...

01:33:30.660 --> 01:33:32.420
for the briefing.

01:33:32.420 --> 01:33:34.750
I'm going to head to the Command Room.

01:33:36.500 --> 01:33:37.840
See you later.

01:33:38.170 --> 01:33:41.260
I'm counting on you to take care of things
when I'm no longer around.

01:33:47.470 --> 01:33:49.560
<i>The decade you've spent...</i>

01:33:49.850 --> 01:33:52.310
<i>You spent all that time
working yourself to the bone,</i>

01:33:52.310 --> 01:33:54.810
<i>desperately trying to escape from
and avert the end of mankind...</i>

01:33:55.100 --> 01:33:59.070
<i>that you saw when you became human.</i>

01:33:59.070 --> 01:34:03.950
<i>Only a nightmarish existence, a hellish freedom.
But it was indeed worth it.</i>

01:34:04.360 --> 01:34:09.620
<i>King Solomon never really got his wish
to become a human.</i>

01:34:11.580 --> 01:34:12.660
<i>Yeah.</i>

01:34:12.960 --> 01:34:17.340
<i>Your wish came true, Romani Archaman.</i>
